      "text": "[9:16PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement on Lagos-Ibadan Expressway is characterized by smooth vehicular movement in both directions. \nTraffic congestion has dissipated on the stretches from Isheri Olowora, River Valley, Kosoko, and Ogunfayo/Ogunrun home/Ogunnusi Road, with motorists experiencing improved travel times. \nFurthermore, traffic flow is satisfactory towards Omole Junction, Excellence, Ogba, Caterpillar, Odo-Eran, and Wempco. \nThe return journey from Wempco to Odo-Eran, Excellence, Ogunnusi Road, Kosoko, River Valley, and Isheri Olowora is also progressing smoothly. \nImportantly, no significant impediments have been reported, and our officials are actively on ground to manage the traffic situation and ensure a seamless travel experience.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
